# Moderation (observed variables): does W moderate the effect of X on Y?
# Tip: mean-centre X and W first (Data page -> Derived variables -> centre),
# then assign the centred copies (c_...) here so that b1 and b2 are
# interpretable as effects at the mean of the other variable.

{{Y:outcome}} ~ b1*{{X:predictor}} + b2*{{W:moderator}} + b3*{{X}}:{{W}}

# b3 is the interaction (moderation) effect
